## Document Cancel

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/document-cancel

**Purpose:** Cancel a running job and return credits summary

**Request:**
```json
{
  "job_id": "uuid",
  "user_id": "discord_user_id",
  "reason": "user_requested"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "job_id": "uuid",
  "previous_status": "processing",
  "new_status": "cancelled",
  "credits": {
    "consumed": { "total_tokens": 7500, "cost_usd": 0.015 },
    "saved": { "total_tokens": 15000, "cost_usd": 0.030 }
  }
}
```

**Error:**
```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": 400,
    "message": "Cannot cancel completed job",
    "status": "INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION"
  }
}
```

**State transitions:**
- pending → cancelled ✅
- processing → cancelled ✅
- completed/failed → ❌ (400)

**API:** PATCH /api/v2/jobs/{job_id}

**RFC:** RFC-017

## Document Structure Extract

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/document-structure-extract

**Purpose:** Generic LLM-powered document extraction with flexible schema.

**Request:**
```json
{
  "text": "# POULET AU CURRY\n\n1. Laver les blancs...",
  "schema": {
    "type": "recipe",
    "fields": {
      "title": "string",
      "servings": "integer",
      "ingredients": [{"name": "string", "quantity": "number", "unit": "string"}]
    }
  },
  "context": { "type": "recipe", "language": "fr" },
  "plugin_context": { "api_keys": { "anthropic": "sk-ant-..." } }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "extracted": { ... },
  "confidence": 0.92,
  "missing_fields": ["description"]
}
```

**RFC:** RFC-018 (Recipe Enrichment)

