## MCP - Documents Estimate

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/documents/estimate

**Description:** Estime le nombre de tokens, pages et credits requis pour traiter un document.

**InputSchema:**
```json
{
  "required": [],
  "properties": {
    "user_id": { "type": "string", "description": "ID utilisateur (optional, tracing)" },
    "guild_id": { "type": "string", "description": "ID serveur Discord (optional, tracing)" },
    "user_request": { "type": "string", "description": "Requete utilisateur (optional, tracing)" },
    "file_url": { "type": "string", "description": "URL du document" },
    "file_base64": { "type": "string", "description": "Document en base64" },
    "file_type": { "type": "string", "description": "Type de fichier (pdf, png, etc.)" },
    "action": { "type": "string", "description": "Action: translate | summarize" },
    "plugin_context": { "type": "object", "description": "Config pricing/ocr_thresholds" }
  },
  "oneOf": [
    { "required": ["file_url"] },
    { "required": ["file_base64"] }
  ]
}
```

**Output:**
- `estimation`: { tokens, pages, ocr_required, detected_language }
- `credits`: { estimated, breakdown, max_possible }
- `ocr_thresholds`: { applied, config }
- `warnings`: array
- `_trace`: { service_response, provider, mode, latency_ms, user_id, guild_id, user_request }

**Analyzable:**
```json
{
  "accepts_image": false,
  "accepts_media": false,
  "output_fields": ["estimation", "credits", "ocr_thresholds", "warnings"],
  "domain": "documents"
}
```

