## Data Lookup Enrich

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/data-lookup-enrich

**Purpose:** Enrich items with external data sources (nutrition, prices, etc.).

**Request:**
```json
{
  "items": [
    {"name": "poulet", "quantity": 650, "unit": "g"},
    {"name": "lait de coco", "quantity": 400, "unit": "ml"}
  ],
  "source": "openfoodfacts",
  "fields": ["energy_kcal", "protein_g", "fat_g", "carbs_g"],
  "aggregate": { "method": "sum", "divide_by": 4 }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "enriched_items": [...],
  "aggregated": {
    "energy_kcal": 536,
    "protein_g": 38
  },
  "data_quality": {
    "matched": 5,
    "estimated": 1,
    "not_found": 0
  }
}
```

**Available sources:**
- `openfoodfacts`: OpenFoodFacts API (free, community)
- `ciqual`: CIQUAL database (Phase 2)
- `custom_api`: Custom API endpoint

**RFC:** RFC-018 (Recipe Enrichment)

## LLM - Request Validator

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/llm-request-validator

**Description:** Validates user requests against a domain context using LLM (RFC-044).

**InputSchema:**
```json
{
  "required": ["user_request", "domain"],
  "properties": {
    "user_request": { "type": "string", "description": "User request to validate" },
    "domain": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["name", "description"],
      "properties": {
        "name": { "type": "string" },
        "description": { "type": "string" },
        "bot_name": { "type": "string" },
        "contradiction_examples": { "type": "array" },
        "constraints_schema": { "type": "object" },
        "user_level_hints": { "type": "object" },
        "out_of_scope_examples": { "type": "array" }
      }
    },
    "has_image": { "type": "boolean", "description": "Has image attachment" },
    "image_attachments": { "type": "array", "description": "Image attachments" },
    "user_id": { "type": "string", "description": "User ID for tracing (optional)" },
    "guild_id": { "type": "string", "description": "Guild ID for tracing (optional)" }
  }
}
```

**Note:** API key from request or env (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY).

**Analyzable:**
```json
{
  "accepts_image": true,
  "accepts_media": false,
  "output_fields": ["is_valid", "issue_type", "user_state", "response"],
  "domain": "nlp"
}
```

## Stripe Subscription Checkout Create

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/subscription-checkout-create

**Purpose:** Creates a Stripe Checkout session for subscription signup.
Acts as a proxy - each project has its own Stripe account.

**Input:**
```json
{
  "project_id": "torah",
  "price_id": "price_xxx",
  "customer_email": "user@example.com",
  "callbacks": {
    "success": "http://...",
    "renewal": "http://..."
  },
  "urls": {
    "success": "https://...",
    "cancel": "https://..."
  },
  "metadata": {},
  "options": {
    "trial_days": 7
  }
}
```

**Output:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "checkout_url": "https://checkout.stripe.com/...",
  "session_id": "cs_xxx"
}
```

**Setup:** Utilise Redis pour la config projet (cle: project:{project_id})
